# VoiceKit is a Windows-only AutoHotkey project. Normalize every text file
# to CRLF in the working tree on checkout, so .ahk scripts, .bat files
# (which can misbehave with LF), and pipe-delimited data land consistently
# on any machine - even one with core.autocrlf disabled. Git still stores
# LF internally, so history stays clean.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Known binary types (none tracked today, but future-proof the shortcuts,
# icons and any recordings/screenshots that might get added).
*.lnk binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
